{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/strategize.png?t=1730477903\" />Carefully plan your route to be as efficient as possible. Avoid backtracking and load your van with delivery order in mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_strategize.gif?t=1730477903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/findShortcuts.png?t=1730477903\" />Explore the map during the route or using the practice mode to find secret paths along the way that could help save precious seconds. This could simply be a breakable fence, a ramp or even a fire hydrant used to clear blocks of houses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_findShortcuts.gif?t=1730477903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/execute.png?t=1730477903\" />Time to take your crafted route to the test. Follow through with your plan and adjust it as needed, there's no shame in restarting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/steamPageGifs_Execute.gif?t=1730477903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563790/extras/practice.png?t=1730477903\" />Hone your package throwing skills in the training mode. Explore maps, routes and test strategies. You'll get detailed information about world position and velocities in this mode along with 